=== S1.1 admin 登录成功（口令=学号，见 seed_users.sql） ===
### admin login
$ curl -s -i -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/auth/login -H Content-Type: application/json -d {"username":"U90000000002","password":"<PW_MASKED>"}
HTTP/1.1 200 
Vary: Origin
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Method
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Headers
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 174
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 03:56:24 GMT

{"token":"<TOKEN_MASKED>","subject":"U90000000002","roles":["admin"],"expires_at":"2026-11-01T03:56:24.083578+00:00","must_change_password":true}


=== S1.2 错误密码 401（响应体与无此用户同体——验收 A/B 语义） ===
### wrong password
$ curl -s -i -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/auth/login -H Content-Type: application/json -d {"username":"U90000000002","password":"<PW_MASKED>"}
HTTP/1.1 401 
Vary: Origin
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Method
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Headers
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 41
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 03:56:24 GMT

{"detail":"invalid username or password"}

### nonexistent user
$ curl -s -i -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/auth/login -H Content-Type: application/json -d {"username":"U99999999999","password":"<PW_MASKED>"}
HTTP/1.1 401 
Vary: Origin
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Method
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Headers
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 41
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 03:56:24 GMT

{"detail":"invalid username or password"}

=== S1.3 无凭据访问 admin 接口 401 ===
### no token GET /api/admin/users
$ curl -s -i http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/admin/users
HTTP/1.1 401 
Vary: Origin
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Method
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Headers
WWW-Authenticate: Bearer
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 46
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 03:56:24 GMT

{"detail":"missing or malformed bearer token"}

### malformed bearer
$ curl -s -i -H Authorization: Bearer not-a-real-token http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/admin/users
HTTP/1.1 401 
Vary: Origin
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Method
Vary: Access-Control-Request-Headers
WWW-Authenticate: Bearer
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 26
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 03:56:24 GMT

{"detail":"invalid token"}

